# Template for local secrets. Committed to git with NAMES ONLY, never values.
# To use: copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored) and fill in values there yourself:
#   Copy-Item .dev.vars.example .dev.vars; notepad .dev.vars
# Online, the same names are set with: npx wrangler secret put NAME
#
# Never prefix a secret with VITE_ : Vite copies VITE_* values into browser code.

# Needed for the Jev decision-model comparison (OpenRouter). Not needed yet.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
